  "Shimanouchi1972": "T. Shimanouchi, Tables of Molecular Vibrational Frequencies, Consolidated Volume I, NSRDS-NBS 39, National Bureau of Standards (1972). DOI: 10.6028/NBS.NSRDS.39. Retrieved via the NIST Chemistry WebBook (SRD 69).",
  "NSRDS-NBS10": "R. D. Nelson, D. R. Lide, A. A. Maryott, Selected Values of Electric Dipole Moments for Molecules in the Gas Phase, NSRDS-NBS 10 (1967). As compiled in CCCBDB-R22.",
